      "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title>Client Confirmation Escalation - Inebura</title></head>\n<body style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f7fa; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #333;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width: 700px; margin: auto; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;\">\n    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #d0c3f1;\">\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"width: 48%; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; padding: 15px 20px;\">\n          <img src=\"https://public-inebura.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/logos/inebura_logo.png\" alt=\"Inebura\" height=\"60\" style=\"max-height: 60px; width: auto;\">\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"width: 4%; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; padding: 10px 0;\">\n          <div style=\"width: 2px; height: 60px; background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 1px;\"></div>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"width: 48%; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; padding: 15px 20px;\">\n          <img src=\"${clientLogo}\" alt=\"${clientName}\" height=\"60\" style=\"border-radius: 6px; max-height: 60px; width: auto; max-width: 150px;\">\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n    <div style=\"padding: 30px;\">\n      <h2 style=\"color: #8a5a10; margin-top: 0;\">Escalation: Client Confirmation remains pending</h2>\n      <p>Hello ${recipientName},</p>\n      <p>Client Confirmation for <strong>${period}</strong> is still pending, and the reminder target of <strong>${ccTargetDate}</strong> is approaching.</p>\n      <p><strong>Client Admins:</strong> please complete Client Confirmation through the applicable upload or No Impacted Invoices action in Inebura.</p>\n      <p><strong>Supervisors:</strong> please coordinate any collection clarifications with your Agents and follow up with a Client Admin. Only a Client Admin can execute Manual Client Confirmation.</p>\n      <div style=\"margin-top: 25px; background-color: #fff3cd; padding: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; font-size: 13px;\">\n        The next Month-End remains blocked until this Client Confirmation is executed.\n      </div>\n      <#if platformUrl?has_content>\n      <p style=\"margin-top: 20px;\"><a href=\"${platformUrl}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#0049b7;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:4px;font-size:14px;\">Open Inebura</a></p>\n      </#if>\n      <p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">Regards,<br><strong>Team Inebura</strong></p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #777; background-color: #f9f9f9;\">&copy; Inebura Technologies. All rights reserved.</div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
