      "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>Scheduled Report - Inebura</title>\n</head>\n\n<body style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f7fa; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #333;\">\n\n<div style=\"max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<!-- Header -->\n<table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #d0c3f1;\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 48%; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; padding: 15px 20px;\">\n<img src=\"https://public-inebura.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/logos/inebura_logo.png\"\n                  alt=\"Inebura Logo\" height=\"60\" style=\"max-height: 60px; width: auto;\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 4%; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; padding: 10px 0;\">\n<div style=\"width: 2px; height: 60px; background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 1px;\"></div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 48%; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; padding: 15px 20px;\">\n<img src=\"${clientLogo}\" alt=\"Client Logo\" height=\"60\"\n                  style=\"border-radius: 6px; max-height: 60px; width: auto; max-width: 150px;\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<!-- Content -->\n<div style=\"padding: 30px;\">\n<p>Hello,</p>\n\n    <p>\n        Please find your scheduled report\n<strong>${reportName}</strong> attached.\n</p>\n\n    <p>\n        The report was generated successfully as per the configured schedule.\n</p>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 20px; background-color: #e7f3ff; padding: 12px; border-left: 4px solid #2196f3; border-radius: 4px;\">\n<strong>Note:</strong> Your scheduled report is ready and has been attached to this email for your review.\n</div>\n\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">\n        Regards,<br>\n\n<strong>Inebura System</strong>\n</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Footer -->\n<div style=\"padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #777; background-color: #f9f9f9;\">\n    © Inebura Technologies. All rights reserved.\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
